      "stem": "曲线 $y = - x ^ { 3 } + x ^ { 2 } + 2 x$ 与 x 轴所围成的图形的面积 A =",
      "options": [],
      "answer": "$\\frac { 3 7 } { 1 2 }$ ．易见 $y = - x ^ { 3 } + x ^ { 2 } + 2 x$ 的零点为 −1, 0, 2，且当 $x \\in ( - 1 , 0 )$ 时 $y < 0$",
      "answerStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "explanation": "解. 应填 $\\frac { 3 7 } { 1 2 }$ ．易见 $y = - x ^ { 3 } + x ^ { 2 } + 2 x$ 的零点为 −1, 0, 2，且当 $x \\in ( - 1 , 0 )$ 时 $y < 0$ ；当$x \\in ( 0 , 2 )$ 时 $y > 0$ ．于是有\n\n$$\nA = \\int_ {- 1} ^ {0} - (- x ^ {3} + x ^ {2} + 2 x) d x + \\int_ {0} ^ {2} (- x ^ {3} + x ^ {2} + 2 x) d x = \\frac {3 7}{1 2}.\n$$",
      "explanationStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "reviewStatus": "needs_human_review",
      "finalizationStatus": "blocked",
