      "answerStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "explanation": "解. 应填 $x f ( x ^ { 2 } )$ ．作变量代换 $u = x ^ { 2 } - t ^ { 2 }$ ，则有\n\n$$\n\\int_ {0} ^ {x} t f \\left(x ^ {2} - t ^ {2}\\right) \\mathrm{d} t = \\int_ {x ^ {2}} ^ {0} - \\frac {1}{2} f (u) \\mathrm{d} u = \\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {0} ^ {x ^ {2}} f (u) \\mathrm{d} u,\n$$\n\n从而导函数为\n\n$$\n\\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} x} \\int_ {0} ^ {x} t f (x ^ {2} - t ^ {2}) \\mathrm{d} t = \\frac {1}{2} \\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} x} \\int_ {0} ^ {x ^ {2}} f (u) \\mathrm{d} u = \\frac {1}{2} f (x ^ {2}) \\cdot (x ^ {2}) ^ {\\prime} = x f (x ^ {2}).\n$$",
